Author: thejuran <thejuran@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Tue Jun 2 19:04:31 2026 -0400

    feat(71-02): add validate_url_ssrf field_validator to InstanceConfig
    
    - New @field_validator("url") named validate_url_ssrf, defined AFTER
      reject_apikey_in_url so Pydantic v2 definition-order guarantee preserves
      the apikey= rejection firing first (Pitfall 2 / T-71-01b)
    - Uses local import to avoid circular import at module level
    - Validates url field unconditionally — disabled instances with metadata/
      link-local URLs are rejected at startup (intended hardening D-01/D-02)
    - Blocks cloud-metadata IPs/hosts + link-local/unspecified/multicast IP literals
    - Permits loopback IP literals + localhost DNS name (same-host *arr, D-02)
    - Web-form strict path (routes.py:561 validate_arr_url) unchanged

diff --git a/triggarr/models/config.py b/triggarr/models/config.py
